# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)

step Journeyman Leatherworking
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs Leatherworking 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Leatherworking trainer teaches it: Alliance Aayndia Floralwind (Ashenvale), Drakk Stonehand (The Hinterlands), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Faldron (Darnassus), Fimble Finespindle (Ironforge), Simon Tanner (Stormwind City) and Telonis (Darnassus); Horde Arthur Moore (Undercity), Brawn (Stranglethorn Vale), Emerii Tallgust (Zephras Isle), Hahrana Ironhide (Feralas), Karolek (Orgrimmar), Krulmoo Fullmoon (The Barrens), Narv Hidecrafter (Desolace), Tarn (Thunder Bluff) and Una (Thunder Bluff). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Fine Leather Belt (from 55, 3s). 75-150 takes about 15s 50c of recipes and 57s of vendor goods, plus 144 Medium Leather, 24 Elixir of Minor Agility and 308 Heavy Leather to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Leatherworking Journeyman
  learn 3763

