  buy 2325 x39 nearest
  buy 14341 x82 nearest

step Pattern: Wicked Leather Gauntlets
  tip Pattern: Wicked Leather Gauntlets teaches Wicked Leather Gauntlets (Leatherworking 235) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: Leonard Porter (Western Plaguelands), limited stock; Horde: Werg Thickblade (Western Plaguelands), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it.
  buy 15725 nearest

step Pattern: Runic Leather Headband
  tip Pattern: Runic Leather Headband teaches Runic Leather Headband (Leatherworking 265) for 2g 20s. Sold by Jase Farlane (Eastern Plaguelands), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it.
  buy 15756 nearest

